### Login (necessário para pegar o token antes de tudo)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wilson@teste.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Criar um cronograma
POST http://localhost:8080/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Semana 1 - Reta final",
  "startDate": "2026-09-08",
  "endDate": "2026-09-14"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("scheduleId", response.body.id);
%}

### Criar um cronograma sem nome (deve funcionar, name é opcional)
POST http://localhost:8080/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-09-15",
  "endDate": "2026-09-21"
}

### Listar todos os cronogramas do usuário logado
GET http://localhost:8080/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar um cronograma específico pelo id
GET http://localhost:8080/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar o cronograma
PUT http://localhost:8080/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Semana 1 - Reta final (atualizado)",
  "startDate": "2026-09-08",
  "endDate": "2026-09-15"
}

### Deletar o cronograma
DELETE http://localhost:8080/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar o cronograma deletado (deve dar erro, já que foi removido)
GET http://localhost:8080/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar cronograma sem token (deve dar 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sem token",
  "startDate": "2026-09-08",
  "endDate": "2026-09-14"
}

### Criar cronograma sem startDate (deve dar 400, validação do @NotNull)
POST http://localhost:8080/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Faltando data de início",
  "endDate": "2026-09-14"
}
